      "content": "got it. so it's basically all about the paper trail. what if someone is being a bit of a \"bad actor\" though? like, if they're intentionally trying to undermine the team or being disruptive on purpose? how do you handle someone who seems to be acting in bad faith rather than just making mistakes?",
